## Tests

**`crates/run/src/fight_tests.rs`**
- `r4852000_a_fight_a_glitch_voided_is_refused_not_reported_as_a_lost_fight`, with `let game = voided_game();`. It fails today. It asserts:
  - `fold(&game).state.result.map(|r| (r.winner, r.reason)) == Some((Winner::Draw, GameOverReason::Voided))`;
  - `fold(&game).state.players[PlayerId::P1].hero.health == 20`;
  - `run_fight_report(&game, PlayerId::P1) == Err(VOIDED_FIGHT.to_string())`, and the same for `PlayerId::P2`.
